        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵayice kweleko, ŵasonganyisye mpingo wosope, ni ŵasalile yosope yele Mlungu ŵatesile mwa jemanjajo, nipo mwele jwalakwe ŵawugulile ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine litala kuti akulupilile. ",
